<title>USA: Motorola says unit wins Australian order.</title>
<headline>Motorola says unit wins Australian order.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON HEIGHTS, Ill. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc said its multimedia group was selected by Australian telecommunications operator  Telstra Corp to provide cable modems for Telstra's rollout of high-speed online data services.</p>
<p>The launch represents the first commercial deployment of high-speed data services in the Asia-Pacific region, Motorola said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
